# Optional. When set, the frontend talks to the FastAPI backend for:
#   - REAL model calls (Prompt lab, JSON lab, capstone) via the provider-agnostic LLM layer
#   - server-side progress sync (PostgreSQL)
# When unset, the app runs fully in the browser: progress lives in localStorage and
# LLM labs use the clearly-labelled SIMULATED provider.
#
#   Vercel (services) or `vercel dev`:  NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=/
#   Separate local backend:             NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:8000
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=/
